+Added ``beacons.status`` execution module function to report, per configured beacon, the epoch time it last actually fired and the error (if any) that firing produced. Status is tracked live as beacons run and requires no minion restart, config change, or log access; beacons that haven't fired yet report ``last_run`` as ``None``.
